{"ticker":"RKLB","updated":"2026-10-30T23:09:42Z","profile":{"longName":"Rocket Lab Corporation","shortName":"Rocket Lab Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://rocketlabcorp.com","fullTimeEmployees":2600,"marketCap":34994962432,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":951.99164,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":45.498466,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":102.15,"targetHighPrice":150.0,"targetLowPrice":64.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.62,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.37264,"operatingMargins":-0.24572,"profitMargins":-0.21511999,"totalRevenue":769145984,"beta":2.938,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":151.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":37.57,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Rocket Lab Corporation, a space company, provides launch services and space systems solutions in the United States, Canada, Japan, and internationally. The company operates through launch services and space systems segments. The company provides launch services, spacecraft design services, spacecraft components, spacecraft manufacturing, optical systems, and other spacecraft and on-orbit management solutions and constellation management services, as well as designs and manufactures small and medium-class rockets and develops flight and ground software. It also designs, manufactures, and sells Electron, an orbital small launch vehicle for small spacecraft launch services, as well as develops Neutron launch vehicles for large constellation deployments, interplanetary missions, and potentially for human spaceflight. In addition, the company designs and manufactures a range of components and subsystems for its launch vehicles and spacecraft. It serves commercial, aerospace prime contractors, and government customers. Rocket Lab Corporation was formerly known as Rocket Lab USA, Inc. and changed its name to Rocket Lab Corporation in August 2021. The company was founded in 2006 and is headquartered in Long Beach, California.","summary_zh":"Rocket Lab Corporation 是一家航太公司，在美國、加拿大、日本和國際上提供發射服務和航太系統解決方案。該公司透過發射服務和太空系統部門運作。該公司提供發射服務、太空船設計服務、太空船零件、太空船製造、光學系統以及其他太空船和在軌管理解決方案和星座管理服務，以及設計和製造中小型火箭以及開發飛行和地面軟體。該公司還設計、製造和銷售 Electron（一種用於小型太空船發射服務的軌道小型運載火箭），並開發用於大型星座部署、行星際任務以及可能用於載人航天的中子運載火箭。此外，該公司還為其運載火箭和太空船設計和製造一系列組件和子系統。它為商業、航空航天主承包商和政府客戶提供服務。 Rocket Lab Corporation 前身為 Rocket Lab USA, Inc.，於 2021 年 8 月更名為 Rocket Lab Corporation。該公司成立於 2006 年，總部位於加州長灘。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":46.75,"h":49.54,"l":45.68,"c":49.31,"v":20305200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":50.27,"h":50.9,"l":43.512,"c":43.53,"v":33322300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":44.16,"h":44.58,"l":42.7,"c":42.99,"v":17273100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":43.565,"h":45.99,"l":42.39,"c":45.84,"v":17362000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":45.5,"h":48.2,"l":45.488,"c":47.73,"v":18846400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":47.01,"h":47.53,"l":45.512,"c":47.03,"v":13243700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":47.53,"h":48.11,"l":45.6,"c":46.17,"v":11638500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":46.32,"h":49.665,"l":46.055,"c":48.43,"v":22816300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":48.98,"h":54.03,"l":48.611,"c":53.34,"v":27889800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":53.58,"h":55.17,"l":52.72,"c":54.04,"v":23957100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":52.0,"h":52.08,"l":47.01,"c":47.245,"v":42608100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":47.565,"h":48.54,"l":46.45,"c":48.08,"v":20731000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":48.92,"h":49.19,"l":47.0,"c":47.18,"v":19434100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":47.68,"h":48.93,"l":47.13,"c":47.79,"v":26870000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":47.13,"h":50.26,"l":46.8,"c":49.81,"v":22995900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":49.025,"h":54.158,"l":47.91,"c":52.91,"v":38064000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":51.795,"h":52.48,"l":48.43,"c":48.69,"v":30681600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":48.0,"h":48.62,"l":45.21,"c":46.63,"v":22418500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":47.3,"h":47.69,"l":45.83,"c":46.26,"v":14907100},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":47.4,"h":48.1,"l":46.37,"c":47.01,"v":16145400},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":