攀升：火箭實驗室宣稱 5.15 億美元的軍事推動——18 顆衛星中的 8 顆正在生產"},{"title":"Rocket Lab's $515 Million Military Satellite Order Hits the Factory Floor as 8 of 18 Spacecraft Enter Build","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTFB6YnBIenF2NHRhV3FhYWxQazVCaDhJWHZFeHZiZS1HTndDelprbzg2R3FIc0lETXU0VG5PeUlqRWJYNGxCWlFzYXdOd09Gb0NYUndsMDluVnc3UlkwdWkteFZxbXNzdWFHaHRwXzU3V1FybTZqNGc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"Rocket Lab 價值 5.15 億美元的軍用衛星訂單已交付工廠，18 顆太空船中的 8 顆進入建造階段"},{"title":"Rocket Lab Soars 15% in a Week as Space Stocks Rebound and Neutron Heads to the Pad","src":"TIKR.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOd3JRXzVGMnFhV05YbENTcEcxWS1aR1ctS2lYRHpPejB3NEdDTG9XeTZsYWFoT0Z1cUFmV0RFZ19pSlNzQkdzMEszODRwejJza3VaQXNLTUNyU3ROc3Q0aWZHQVFpZ28wZHNJSGJBc0lpOGUwdk9Fcl85N1hLOVBjajVNLWJzcS1VYUd0amt4S2pSUU13cEpxY3NkbTdWc0c5dG1ycl8tVGJrNnJ0?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"隨著太空股反彈和 Neutron 上漲，Rocket Lab 一週內飆漲 15%"},{"title":"Rocket Lab signs largest-ever Electron launch deal with Synspective","src":"SatellitePro ME","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOeUhxcndrWFNkSndCSV94NjZxeGNqRlRkbzViZUtINXdseWhtMDdzckYzZ3pSeVZPS3RpTTNyTXhfS0xicmF2SWotZlJkWDNKamNoeUJWMFpnelp3SDN3NGlQUDZ1S3ZQc0dMV2dobTUyNjV2cl9oNjRteENMcm5yb2N4QS15YURaVUR4Q1h2bE94QVdiRk10X0lmQXNycVc5Wmc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"Rocket Lab 與 Synspective 簽署有史以來最大的 Electron 發射協議"}],"themes":[{"name":"國防/軍工","count":2},{"name":"自駕/機器人","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-26","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1819994/000181999426000013/rklb-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Rocket Lab is an end-to-end space company with an established track record of mission success. We deliver reliable launch services, spacecraft design services, spacecraft components, spacecraft manufacturing, optical systems and other spacecraft and on-orbit management solutions that make it faster, easier and more affordable to access space. We believe that space has defined some of humanity's greatest achievements and it continues to shape our future. We are motivated by the impact we can have on Earth by making it easier to get to space and using it as a platform for innovation, exploration and infrastructure.","zh":"Rocket Lab 是一家端到端太空公司，擁有良好的任務成功記錄。我們提供可靠的發射服務、太空船設計服務、太空船組件、太空船製造、光學系統以及其他太空船和在軌管理解決方案，使進入太空更快、更容易、更經濟。我們相信，太空創造了人類最偉大的成就，並將繼續塑造我們的未來。我們的動力來自於我們可以透過讓進入太空變得更容易並將其用作創新、探索和基礎設施的平台來對地球產生影響。"},{"en":"As one of select few commercial companies delivering regular access to orbit, our proven launch vehicle, spacecraft technology and global infrastructure uniquely position us to grow in this dynamic market. Advances in technologies, materials and components have led to miniaturization of spacecraft and a significant reduction in cost and time-to-market, concurrent with the increase in demand for space applications such as communications, remote sensing, Earth observation, meteorology and navigation. We provide customers with frequent, reliable and cost-effective access to orbit with Electron, a fully carbon composite launch vehicle powered by Rutherford, our electric turbopump 3D printed engines. Since our first Electron launch in 2017 through December 31, 2025, we have delivered over 200 spacecraft to orbit across 75 successful missions for commercial and government customers, including ","zh":"作為少數提供定期進入軌道的商業公司之一，我們成熟的運載火箭、太空船技術和全球基礎設施使我們在這個充滿活力的市場中獲得獨特的發展。技術、材料和零件的進步導致太空船小型化，並大幅降低成本和縮短上市時間，同時通訊、遙感、地球觀測、氣象和導航等太空應用的需求增加。我們使用 Electron 為客戶提供頻繁、可靠且經濟高效的軌道進入，Electron 是一種全碳複合材料運載火箭，由我們的電動渦輪泵 3D 列印引擎 Rutherford 提供動力。自 2017 年首次 Electron 發射以來，到 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們已為商業和政府客戶完成 75 次成功任務，將 200 多艘太空船送入軌道，其中包括"},{"en":"Rocket Lab's frequent launch cadence has been enabled through innovative manufacturing techniques for Electron, including 3D printing and automation, but production is only part of the formula for frequent and reliable launch. We believe our launch infrastructure is a key part of our success. We currently operate a private launch complex located in Mahia, New Zealand, which we refer to as Launch Complex 1 (\"LC-1\"). This launch complex is supported by a bi-lateral treaty between the United States and New Zealand governments that enables us to use U.S. launch and spacecraft technology for launches at LC-1 that otherwise would not be permitted for launches from foreign soil. This treaty provides us with a competitive advantage over other companies launching rockets from outside the U.S. that do not have the benefit of such a treaty. Additionally, by operating our own private launch complex,","zh":"Rocket Lab 的頻繁發射節奏是透過 Electron 的創新製造技術實現的，包括 3D 列印和自動化，但生產只是頻繁、可靠發射方案的一部分。我們相信我們的發射基礎設施是我們成功的關鍵部分。我們目前在新西蘭馬希亞經營一個私人發射場，我們稱之為 1 號發射場（「LC-1」）。該發射綜合體得到了美國和紐西蘭政府之間的雙邊條約的支持，該條約使我們能夠使用美國的發射和太空船技術在 LC-1 上進行發射，否則不允許從外國領土發射。該條約為我們提供了比其他從美國境外發射火箭但沒有受益於該條約的公司的競爭優勢。此外，透過運營我們自己的私人發射綜合設施，"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Launch Services. As of December 31, 2025, we have launched and deployed over 200 spacecraft for our customers, which includes government customers, such as the United States Department of War (\"DoW\"), NASA and other U.S. government agencies. We also provide launch services to major domestic and international commercial and government spacecraft operators. Our launch services have been used by more than 20 organizations.","zh":"啟動服務。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們已為客戶發射和部署了 200 多艘太空船，其中包括美國戰爭部 (“DoW”)、NASA 和其他美國政府機構等政府客戶。我們也為國內外主要商業和政府太空船營運商提供發射服務。我們的啟動服務已被 20 多個組織使用。"},{"en":"Space Systems. As of December 31, 2025, we have flight hardware on over 1,800 missions, including legacy missions enabled by Sinclair Interplanetary (acquired April 2020), Advanced Solutions, Incorporated (acquired October 2021), Planetary Systems Corporation (acquired November 2021), SolAero Technologies Corp. (acquired January 2022) and GEOST LLC (\"GEOST\") (acquired August 2025). Our space systems have been used by a diverse mix of commercial, aerospace prime contractors and government customers.","zh":"空間系統。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們在 1,800 多項任務中擁有飛行硬件，包括 Sinclair Interplanetary（2020 年 4 月收購）、Advanced Solutions, Incorporated（2021 年 10 月收購）、Planetary Systems Corporation（2021 年 11 月收購）、SolST Technologies. LLC（「GEOST」）（2021 年 10 月收購）支援的舊任務2025 年 8 月）。我們的太空系統已被各種商業、航空航天主承包商和政府客戶使用。"}],"competition":[{"en":"companies providing dedicated and rideshare launch vehicles to deliver payloads to generic and custom planes/inclinations and altitude trajectories, such as Northrop Grumman, SpaceX, United Launch Alliance (a joint venture between Lockheed Martin Corporation and The Boeing Company), Firefly, Blue Origin, and established Russian, Indian, Chinese, European and Japanese launch providers;","zh":"提供專用和共享運載火箭以將有效載荷運送到通用和定制飛機/傾角和高度軌蹟的公司，例如諾斯羅普·格魯曼公司、SpaceX、聯合發射聯盟（洛克希德·馬丁公司和波音公司的合資企業）、Firefly、藍色起源以及成熟的俄羅斯、印度、中國、歐洲和日本發射提供商；"},{"en":"companies that are reported to have plans to provide launch vehicles that can deliver payloads to a range of planes/inclinations and altitude trajectories;","zh":"據報道，公司計劃提供運載火箭，可以將有效載荷運送到一系列飛機/傾斜度和高度軌跡；"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Space Systems","val":402757000,"zh":"空間系統"},{"name":"Launch Services","val":199042000,"zh":"啟動服務"}],"total":601799000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Space Systems","val":402757000,"zh":"空間系統"},{"name":"Service","val":230182000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Launch Services","val":199042000,"zh":"啟動服務"}],"total":601799000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":475394000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"JP","val":65638000,"zh":"日本"},{"name":"Rest Of World","val":40601000,"zh":"世界其他地區"},{"name":"CA","val":20166000,"zh":"加拿大"}],"total":601799000}},"peers":["ASTS","NBIS","IONQ","IREN","CRWV"]}}